@startuml
!include skin.iuml
rectangle "Jira ticket\n(bug or feature)" as J
rectangle "Code change\n(.NET C# / React)" as C
rectangle "Azure DevOps\npipeline: build + test" as P
rectangle "Azure DevOps\nrelease" as R
rectangle "Azure-hosted\ne-commerce site" as S
rectangle "Azure metrics + logs" as M
J -> C
C -> P
P -> R
R -> S
S -> M : slow-response alerts
M ..> J : new L3 ticket
note bottom of M
Example: slow responses traced to full log storage.
Fix: archive old logs, response times recovered.
end note
@enduml
